sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor V as Visitor
    participant W as web container
    participant A as api container
    participant DB as postgres as app_public
    participant E as FastEmbed in api
    participant B as ollama-bridge
    participant O as Ollama qwen3.6

    V->>W: GET /chat
    W-->>V: chat page HTML
    V->>W: GET /api/public/config
    Note over W,A: Next rewrites this to GET /public/config
    W->>A: GET /public/config
    A-->>V: company name and careers URL
    V->>W: POST /api/public/chat
    Note over V,W: body is the question plus prior_codes
    W->>A: POST /public/chat
    A->>A: refuse people questions before any SQL
    A->>A: 30 questions per hour per IP
    A->>DB: open jobs that match the parsed question
    DB-->>A: the job set SQL allowed
    opt ordinary skill search
        A->>E: embed the question and rerank that set
    end
    A->>B: chat completion, think off, 90 second timeout
    B->>O: forward to 127.0.0.1:11434
    O-->>A: two to four sentences
    A-->>V: answer, job cards, prior_codes
    Note over V,W: The server stores no chat history. The browser keeps prior_codes.
